#lang rzk-1

-- G10 probe 4 (session a15f4b3b, 2026-10-21): univalence is not built in; a theory that wants it
-- has to state it as a postulate.  Here a stand-in "every type has a non-trivial self-path" is
-- postulated, only to show that #postulate is the route.
-- Expected: accepted (postulates are allowed; nothing built in supplies such a path).

#postulate self-path
  ( A : U)
  : A = A
